# GitHub Actions / npm publish

- Workflow: `.github/workflows/ci.yml` — quality on PR/push; release job on `main` push.
- Release: build → `npm publish --provenance --access public` → GitHub release → semantic-release.
- Prefer **trusted publishing** (OIDC) over long-lived `NPM_TOKEN` in secrets.
- Conventional Commits drive semantic-release (see `commit-messages.mdc` and `.releaserc.json`).
- Do not force-publish broken builds; fix quality job first.
- First publish requires npm package Trusted Publisher linked to this repo + `ci.yml`.
